(3) R12-1 ray test on the JS slice p_xi = 0: max_c |D_JS(0, t u; k)| / |s_grav(t u)|,  s_grav(q) = sqrt(2)|q|^2
    D_JS(0,q;k)_c = i aT(q,k) (q_c - (P_c(k+q) - P_c(k))),  aT = (eps(k+q)+eps(k))/2   [R12-1 conventions]
